      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If you are experiencing a cough and you're taking sertraline, it can be a good idea to speak with your doctor before taking over-the-counter medications like Robitussin. Combining dextromethorphan with sertraline might affect how your body processes either medication. If the cough persists, your doctor may recommend other cough remedies that are safer to take together with your current medication.",
