      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i dont want to wait days for a doc appointment just for a cough. i looked it up real quick on a forum and people were saying it's fine as long as u dont take a ton of it. is there like a specific dose i should stick to so i dont have any issues? i just really need to sleep tonight.",
